      "message": "I initially made this method @VisibleForTesting and added a test in LocationFudgerTest with lat\u003d90. which should trigger this condition. Sadly because the conversion from degrees to radian is inexact, cosLat was very close to zero but non-zero. \n\nHaving a test with lat\u003d89.xxxxx or 90.xxxxx would be semantically wrong IMO. What should trigger a division by zero is lat\u003d90.\n\nI think the best step forward is either to carefully review this manually and submit without test, and/or drop this change altogether if we consider it too rare to occur. WDYT ?",
